{
  "id": 8867180183751,
  "title": "Personalized Baseball Bedding Full Size Flag Custom Name D - Design 23",
  "handle": "personalized-baseball-bedding-full-size-flag-custom-name-d-design-23",
  "body_html": "<p>Experience the ultimate blend of comfort and personalized style with this custom Baseball Comforter Set from Jeminise. Designed for baseball enthusiasts, this set allows you to personalize your bedding, adding a unique touch to your bedroom decor while celebrating your passion for the sport.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize with your own name, adding a unique and personal touch to your bedding.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Sporty Theme:</strong> Perfect for baseball players, fans, and lovers, featuring a vibrant Baseball On Field pattern.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Comfy Material:</strong> Made from 100% Brushed Polyester Fabric with Whole-Piece Microfiber Filling for a soft, durable, and lightweight feel.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), and US King (104\" x 88\") to fit various bed sizes.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; air dry without heat for quick drying and fluffiness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> An ideal gift for men and women, moms and dads, for occasions like Valentine's Day, Mother's Day, Father's Day, and Christmas.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Manufacturing:</strong> Features environmental protection dyeing techniques to prevent fading and smooth, fine, compact stitching for lasting quality.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester, Cotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Baseball Thunder</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Baseball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), US King (104\" x 88\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Breathable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>400</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
